    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d371">

                <pb facs="0492" n="412" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg412"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Loubet to President Roosevelt</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic">May 11,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I thank Your Excellency for the expression of profound sympathy you have sent me
                    in the name of the American people on the occasion of the awful catastrophe in
                    Martinique. The French people will certainly join me in thanks to the American
                    people.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Emile Loubet.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
